OL,3,AMedia industry could be forced to
OL,4,Aimprove safeguards after Walliams
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government is prepared to force the
OL,8,Fentertainment industry to improve
OL,9,Fsafeguarding practices unless rapid
OL,10,Fchange is introduced, BBC Newsnight has
OL,11,Flearned.
OL,13,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy will tell
OL,14,Fa meeting of industry leaders next week
OL,15,Fthat if their response to recent
OL,16,Fallegations is not robust enough, she
OL,17,Fis prepared to force participation in
OL,18,Fthe industry body to protect
OL,19,Fwhistleblowers, the BBC understands.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
