OL,3,AMedia industry could be forced to
OL,4,Aimprove safeguards after Walliams
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FParticipation in the Creative
OL,8,FIndustries Independent Standards
OL,9,FAuthority (CIISA) is currently
OL,10,Fvoluntary.
OL,12,FIt comes after an investigation by the
OL,13,FGuardian and ITV News alleged that
OL,14,Fentertainer David Walliams had been
OL,15,Faccused by several women of sexual
OL,16,Fmisconduct and abusing his position,
OL,17,Fwhich he denies.
